   "phrasing": "greet_ans_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What's the difference between a latte and a flat white?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.5,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "coffee.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "A flat white has less milk and a thinner layer of foam, so it tastes stronger. A latte is bigger and milkier.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.73,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "coffee.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And a cappuccino?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.25,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "coffee.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "A cappuccino has a thick layer of foam on top, and it's usually smaller than a latte.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 1.14,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "coffee.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "So if I want something",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.68,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "coffee.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "not too milky but still creamy?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 2.62,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "coffee.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "A flat white is probably your best bet. Strong coffee flavour with a smooth, velvety texture.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 1.53,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "coffee.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, I'm going to order one tomorrow and see.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.72,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "coffee.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Enjoy it. If it's too strong, you can always ask for an extra splash of milk.",
